<view class="page-shell"><view class="hero-card"><view class="eyebrow">移动运营</view><view class="hero-title">学长查询</view><view class="hero-copy">仅查询当前组织授权范围内的学长，联系方式保持脱敏。</view></view><view class="section-card"><input class="field-input" value="{{name}}" bindinput="handleInput" placeholder="输入学长姓名"/><button class="primary-button" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="search">查询</button></view><view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="state-card error">{{errorMessage}}</view><view wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="member_id" class="section-card"><view class="section-title">{{item.name}}</view><view>{{item.org_name}} · {{item.class_name || '暂未关联班级'}} · {{item.group_name || '暂未关联小组'}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.phone_masked || '联系方式未展示'}}</view></view></view>
